  "description": "After the war broke out. The family of the young and south goes to the home of the host in the south. In the house of the aunt, a woman in a gloomy atmosphere first sees herself as a new aunt. The old lady lying in the body with a bandage all over her body is also strange. Aunt who takes blood consciousness alone in the middle of the night. Grandmother ghost unknown. Father and mother where the missing. Can Young-nam and young brother Young-soon, who are in chaos and fear, escape this house safely? \n\n(Source: Naver Series translated)",
